    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue:</h2></li></ul><br>For generations, the Suprema Alliance, comprised of a portion of the human and elven kingdoms, was able to hold off the Shadow hordes, driving them from their territory to beyond the gates of Astraluminus, the bastion that saw the end of the Eternal War. However, the peace is under attack again, the legions of orcs and undead from southern Vanalem advance unopposed by the impassivity of the former members of the Supreme Alliance, now neutral among themselves due to numerous diplomatic frictions, and not so diplomatic.<br><br>You, General of the Magical Order of Solstice, find yourself in Orfalion, when you sense the approaching evil...<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2></li></ul><br><i><strong>- Combination of views/game modes:</strong></i> You can choose between using the third-person view both to control your hero and to recruit units and produce improvements in your buildings, but if you wish, you can also switch to a classic aerial view to be able to visualize the map and carry out recruitments and improvements in the same way. You choose.<br><br><i><strong>- RTS/RPG mix:</strong></i> From controlling your hero and attacking your enemies with the weapons of your choice, to recruiting an army that will do your dirty work for you.<br><br><i><strong>- Make History:</strong></i> Fight your way through a fantastic campaign filled with secrets to discover and evils to banish.<br><br><i><strong>- Command:</strong></i> Command your armies from the 4 factions in the game using orders and changing their formation according to the strategy you want to carry out.<br><br><i><strong>- Conquest:</strong></i> Dominate the battlefield and capture the different positions that are in them, which will grant you from resources to unique units.<br><br><i><strong>- Level up:</strong></i> Both you and your units can level up, increasing characteristics to higher levels, increasing your legend.<br><br><i><strong>- Customize:</strong></i> Choose from numerous customization options to make your hero unique.",
